      "contract": "graph-math-step/v2",
      "display_unit": "ranges",
      "explanation": "$\\text{先使 }g\\text{ 的输入区间非空：}a \\geq 1$\n$\\text{需 }\\max f<\\max g$\n$\\text{因此先读出两边的最大值}$\n$f(x)=x - \\frac{1}{x},\\ x\\in[-2,-1]$\n$\\therefore\\ f\\text{ 的最大值}=0$\n$g(x)=\\left(x - 2\\right)^2-7,\\ x\\in[1,a]$\n$\\because\\ a\\in \\left[1, 3\\right],\\ \\therefore\\ g\\text{ 的最大值}=-6$\n$\\because\\ a\\in \\left(3, \\infty\\right),\\ \\therefore\\ g\\text{ 的最大值}=a^{2} - 4 a - 3$",
      "highlight": {
        "caption": "求 g 的最大值：按端点高低分成两类",
        "connector": "⇒",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "已知与当前范围",
            "math": "g(a)-g(1)=\\left(a - 3\\right) \\left(a - 1\\right)"
          },
          {
            "label": "$a$ 的分类",
            "math": "\\begin{cases}g_{\\max}=g(1),& a\\in \\left[1, 3\\right]\\\\g_{\\max}=g(a),& a\\in \\left(3, \\infty\\right)\\end{cases}"
          }
        ],
        "layout": "derivation"
      },
      "lesson_version": "a7ed0c78bcb5ced5d6df385f596efe88e73cedb3cf927c4eab26c6b986da206a",
      "local_check": "passed",
